# HTML Basic Tags Cheat Sheet

| Tag | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `<h1>` to `<h6>` | Headings |
| `<p>` | Paragraph |
| `<br>` | Line break |
| `<hr>` | Horizontal line |
| `<a href="">` | Link |
| `<img src="" alt="">` | Image |
| `<ul>` | Unordered List |
| `<ol>` | Ordered List |
| `<li>` | List Item |
| `<table>` | Table |
| `<tr>` | Table Row |
| `<td>` | Table Data |
| `<th>` | Table Heading |
| `<div>` | Division/Container |
| `<span>` | Inline Container |
| `<form>` | Form |
| `<input>` | Input Field |
| `<button>` | Button |

## Example

```html
<h1>Welcome</h1>
<p>This is a paragraph.</p>

<a href="https://example.com">Visit Website</a>

<img src="image.jpg" alt="Sample Image">

<ul>
  <li>Apple</li>
  <li>Banana</li>
</ul>

<button>Click Me</button>
```
